  "place": "dungeon lava_tube set A (The Brineglass Tubes, Blackstrand, level 11-13): the end boss where the tube meets the sea",
  "_doc": "A warden of sea-glass that the old islanders set to keep the tide out of the tubes; now it keeps everyone out. P1 \"Tide Gate\": a glass hammer cone, shards thrown at random players, and the TIDE — sea water rushes in from one side as a sweep of lines; four cooling vents in the floor hiss steam (stand in one and burn), but if you lure the Matron onto a vent the steam cracks her glass (stun + takes more, once per vent). P2 at 60% \"Saltglass Ward\": she seals herself in salt-glass; light the three tide lamps to break it (or it fades by itself). P3 new bar \"Molten Heart\": the glass splits and her core shows — the floor around her heats in a ring (stand close or far), a three-player soak of falling glass, and a spreading spray of droplets.",
  "party": "Solo: hard; use the vents, skip nothing. 2-3: the tank drags her onto vents; one runs the lamps. 5: as designed — the soak needs three.",
